---
// src/components/IndiceHerramientasEn.astro
// Interactive Engineering Tools Index/Directory - Theme Lime Green (#8CC63F)
---
<div class="card" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: 30px; margin-bottom: 40px; background: rgba(25, 28, 30, 0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);">
