      <button type="button" class="idx-cat-btn-en" data-cat="climate" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); color: var(--text-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;">
        🌡️ HVAC & Insulation
